      //   place_api = PU (cyan) — PUSH TO PLEX (API) / RE-PUSH (API) / SWITCH TO API
      // v1.14.48: renamed `cloud` → `plex` to match the recovery-card
      // `tone: "plex"` / `btn-plex` vocab (the class was unused pre-
